The quorum of the general assembly is one third of the members present, as established by the amendment adopted 2 May 2026. Where the amendment of 2 May 2026 and the bylaws differ, the amendment applies.

[[cite:obs-447b19c5077175503ca3f636b6a991d2b7fc29de "Section Quorum is amended: the general assembly has a quorum when one third of the members are present."]]
